WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.460
Here's a machine that can
only add and multiply.

2
00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:07.110
Ask it for sine of nought
point three, in radians.

3
00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:08.990
It has no sine button.

4
00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:12.550
So how could adding and
multiplying ever give a sine?

5
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.890
Could it store a table of every value?

6
00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.540
Could it simply answer nought point three?

7
00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.310
In this mission, you'll build a polynomial
whose value and derivatives at x equals

8
00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.530
nought match the function's.

9
00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:28.410
Each extra term improves the
approximation near nought.

10
00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:33.410
Your mission: work out how a calculator
could find sine of nought point three

11
00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:35.790
using only adding and multiplying.
